{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508780/extras/Scene.gif?t=1745495346\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world ravaged by plague, a lone plague doctor embarks on a journey to stop both the disease and a sinister order of knights controlling it. Dr. Plague is a stealth-adventure game that combines puzzle-solving, platforming, and ambient soundtracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through 4 chapters each with a distinct location, ambience &amp; soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use innovative stealth mechanics to bypass guards, plagues and obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel the mystery of the stalking crows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich atmosphere and intense moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tightly crafted, atmospheric adventure lasting over 2 hours</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508780/extras/Stealth-optimized.gif?t=1745495346\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will You Succeed?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You are not a fighter but you are the only hope. Good luck!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508780?t=1745495346","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745495346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508780/f8ae522de93aa6466bb71a18a1fc7ed00f3c83ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745495346","capsule_imagev5":"ht